  "bugs": [
    "Orianna's ultimate effect and hitbox stay in place when she casts it before the ball reaches a fast-moving ally such as Nocturne.",
    "A Depth Charge stolen from Nautilus by Sylas no longer fizzles when Sylas loses sight of the target.",
    "Xin Zhao's Three Talon Strike no longer goes fully on cooldown when its first attack is dodged by spells such as Shen's Shadow Dash or Jax's Counter Strike.",
    "Shyvana's Dragon's Descent cancels enemy teleports.",
    "Kayle's Reckoning no longer applies the Spellblade on-hit of Sheen, Lich Bane, Trinity Force and Iceborne Gauntlet.",
    "Large melee champions attacking large enemy champions are now inside the immolate radius.",
    "Rune page tabs no longer overflow and clip the editor with more than 20 pages.",
    "Sivir's Spell Shield blocks Leona's Zenith Blade.",
    "The tab buttons of the champion overview window are aligned and usable again.",
    "Several Classic summoner spell icons fill their whole square.",
    "Malphite's Flash is no longer disabled after Unstoppable Force.",
    "Buying the Royal Guard Fiora skin grants the Royal Guard Classic chroma.",
    "Classic mode homepage images no longer load when logging into another tab.",
    "The Release Date ascending and descending sorts give different orders in the Classic Collection portrait tab.",
    "The Recommended sort option is back in the Classic store's Runes section.",
    "The Release Date sort orders runes correctly in the Classic store.",
    "Pressing Recall rapidly no longer builds Guinsoo's Rageblade stacks.",
    "Xin Zhao's Imperial Classic chroma shows its name in champion select.",
    "Runaan's Hurricane bolts no longer trigger minions' call for help.",
    "Sivir's Spell Shield blocks damage from Miss Fortune's Q.",
    "Sona's E description no longer says its effect only applies to champions.",
    "Several Classic item icons fill their whole square."
  ]
